{{definition equivalence|normal subgroup}}
[[Difficulty level::3| ]]
==Statement==

The following are equivalent for a [[subgroup]] <math>H</math> of a [[group]] <math>G</math> :

# <math>H</math> is a [[normal subgroup]] of <math>G</math>.
# <math>H</math> is a '''potentially characteristic subgroup''' of <math>G</math> in the following sense: there exists a [[group]] <math>K</math> containing <math>G</math> such that <math>H</math> is a [[characteristic subgroup]] of <math>K</math>.

