'''Given''': A group <math>G</math>, a subgroup <math>H</math> of <math>G</math>, a group <math>K</math> containing <math>G</math> such that <math>H</math> is characteristic in <math>K</math>.

'''To prove''': <math>H</math> is normal in <math>G</math>.

'''Proof''':

